- Dave ate 14 fries (34 left)
- Seagull ate 7 fries (27 left)
- Pigeons ate 9 fries (18 left)
- Raccoon ate 12 fries (6 left)
- Ants took 1 fry (5 left)
- Total: 14 + 7 + 9 + 12 + 1 + 5 = 48

